Seduce this
humble newsy？

295
00:18:30,572 --> 00:18:35,252
Oh，what's a
paperboy to？

296
00:18:49,331 --> 00:18:50,531
史黛拉

297
00:18:52,651 --> 00:18:54,211
史黛拉

298
